              "name": "getAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>url</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 请求 URL</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"httpRequestBuilderOptionsType\">HttpRequestBuilderOptions</a> } - 请求和运行时选项</li>\n<li><strong>[ callback ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">Function</a> } - 可选成功回调</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a> } - 兑现值为 <a href=\"httpResponseType\">HttpResponse</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>在后台线程发送 GET 请求.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">http.getAsync(&quot;https://example.com&quot;)\n    .then((response) =&gt; {\n        console.log(response.statusCode);\n    })\n    .catch((error) =&gt; {\n        console.error(error);\n    });\n</code></pre>\n",
